          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 89772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo assegnare un valore alle variabili di classe durante la costruzione dell'istanza della classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungendoli come parametro nella funzione init e impostando la variabile sul valore del parametro</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Le variabili di classe devono avere un valore fisso</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo accedere alle variabili di classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungendoli come parametro nella funzione init e impostando la variabile sul valore del parametro.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per impostare le variabili di classe quando crei un'istanza, aggiungi parametri a <code>__init__</code> e assegna i valori alle variabili.</p><p>Un <code>Book</code> riceve un <code>title</code> quando viene creato. Quale costruttore memorizza questo valore nell'istanza?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>def __init__(self, title): self.title = title</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>def __init__(self, title): self.title = \"title\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>def __init__(self, title): title = self.title</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>def __init__(self, title): self.title = title</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 89773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un costruttore per la classe <code>Song</code> che accetti un <code>name</code> e un <code>artist</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Song\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, artist)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.artist = artist\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>def</code>, seguito da <code>__init__</code> e poi <code>(</code>, <code>self</code>, <code>artist</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un costruttore per la classe <code>Song</code> che accetti un <code>name</code> e un <code>artist</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Song\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, artist)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.artist = artist\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"__int__\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Self\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>def</code>, seguito da <code>__init__</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>self</code>, <code>artist</code>, <code>)</code> e infine <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>"
